<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Ved Vivah Admin Password Reset</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @font-face {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova regular";
      src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Regular.otf') format("opentype");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova thin";
      src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Thin.otf') format("opentype");
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova regular", sans-serif;
      background-color: #fff5f7;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#ffc0cb 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova thin", sans-serif;
      color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #ffebee;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .main::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4081, #ff80ab);
    }

    #title {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    #name {
      color: #d81b60;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .content h3 {
      margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
      color: #d81b60;
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 700;
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .content h3::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -10px;
      left: 0;
      width: 60px;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4081, #ff80ab);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .content p {
      margin: 1.8rem 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
    }

    .otp {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 15px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .otp div {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4081, #ff80ab);
      border-radius: 12px;
      min-width: 70px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.2);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    #thakyou {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #d81b60;
    }

    .footer {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #888;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ffebee;
    }

    a {
      color: #d81b60;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: #ff4081;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    .heart {
      color: #ff4081;
      animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    @keyframes heartbeat {
      0%, 50%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      25%, 75% { transform: scale(1.1); }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .main { padding: 1.8rem; }
      .content h3 { font-size: 32px; }
      .otp div { font-size: 32px; padding: 12px 20px; min-width: 60px; }
      .content p { font-size: 14px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="main">
      <a href="https://www.vaidikvivah.in">
        <img src="file:///Users/abhishekkumar/Downloads/Vaidik_vivah_Backend/assets/v.png"
             alt="Ved Vivah Logo"
             style="max-width: 300px;"
             class="floating" />
      </a>
      <div class="content">
        <h2 id="title">Reset Your <span id="name">Ved Vivah Admin Password</span></h2>
        <h3>Password Reset OTP</h3>
        <p>Dear Admin,</p>
        <p>We received a request to reset your Ved Vivah Admin password. Use the One-Time Password (OTP) below to complete your password reset:</p>

        <div class="otp">
          <% activationCode.split('').forEach((char) => { %>
            <div><%= char %></div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>

        <p>This OTP is valid for <strong>5 minutes</strong>. For security reasons, do not share it with anyone. If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email — your password will remain unchanged.</p>

        <p id="thakyou">With <span class="heart">♥</span>, The Ved Vivah Admin Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2025 Ved Vivah Admin Portal. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p><a href="https://admin.vaidikvivah.in">https://admin.vaidikvivah.in</a></p>
        <p>Need help? <a href="mailto:support@vaidikvivah.in">Contact our support team</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
